class=\"Z3988\"><span style=\"display:none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"外部連結\"><span id=\".E5.A4.96.E9.83.A8.E9.80.A3.E7.B5.90\"></span>外部連結</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%9E%9C%E5%87%8D&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"編輯章節：外部連結\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.historicfood.com/Jellies.htm\">Jelly, Flummery and Creams</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20180128082607/http://www.historicfood.com/Jellies.htm\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>）</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://brands.kraftfoods.com/jello/explore/history/\">Kraft Foods: Jell-O history</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20110317033528/http://brands.kraftfoods.com/jello/explore/history/\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>）</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://faculty.cooper.edu/topper/general/gelatin/gel.html\">Cooper Union history page</a> （<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20210226155055/http://faculty.cooper.edu/topper/general/gelatin/gel.html\">頁面存檔備份</a>，存於<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"網際網路檔案館\">網際網路檔案館</a>）</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20160304023203/https://prospectbooks.co.uk/samples/Jellies.pdf\">Peter Brears <i>Jellies and Their Moulds</i> Prospect Books  2010</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://foodhistorjottings.blogspot.se